The benchmark admission gates are absolute daily IC ≥ 0.0070 and absolute daily ICIR ≥ 0.0840. Only the VIX-conditioned reversal satisfies both gates.

The VIX-conditioned factor remained positive in every calendar year from 2020 through 2026. Its weakest periods were 2023 and 2025, but the yearly ICs remained positive. The factor has high pooled correlation with the unconditioned five-day reversal signal, approximately 0.921, indicating substantial redundancy that should be considered during ensemble construction.

