The benchmark admission gates are absolute daily IC ≥ 0.0070 and absolute daily ICIR ≥ 0.0840. None of the newly explored factors passed both daily gates.

The market-neutral residual reversal showed strong ten-session performance, but its daily signal had only 101 valid dates and very low effective coverage because of the implementation’s alignment issue. It therefore does not qualify for persistence.

The two-speed reversal was broadly covered but had insufficient ICIR and unstable regime behavior:

