   - Construction:  
     \[
     -\operatorname{mean}_{3d}\left(\frac{\text{open}_t}{\text{close}_{t-1}}-1\right)
     \]
   - Motivation: repeated overnight gaps may create short-term cross-asset mean reversion.
   - Result: passed the daily IC and ICIR admission gates.

